// English fortune slips (from Divination-PWA/qian-en.js)
import Foundation

let QIAN_EN: [[String]] = [
    ["Slip 1", "Great Auspicious", "Dragon Transforms", "The dragon transforms and meets its hour of joy. This day it rises, and hopes are fulfilled. Plans and profit bring much celebration. Seeking office and advancement meets no doubt.", "Ambition fills the breast and soars toward the sky. A gentleman will not long remain in want. This journey meets the gathering of wind and cloud. Among ten thousand heads, a hero stands revealed.", "The three yangs join and turn the great wheel. Auspicious qi greets the gate; all things renew. The harvest ripens; wealth and rank flourish. Population grows; kinship brings delight.", "Marriage is the world's great rite. Heaven pairs as mortals scarcely grasp. If you know yourself and align with Heaven's way, why trouble the gods with anxious asking?", "Do not blame Heaven for chance-lost goods. Know that their trail lies toward the south. In time word will come. Do not wrong the innocent as thieves.", "No writ has yet been issued; do not rage. Though the court is fair, the case is hard to press. Better quench the fire in your breast than spend your coin to another's gain.", "The hexagram shows the flying dragon; ask not of kin. Across a thousand hills and waters, hardship waits. Wait until the bright moon rounds again. West beyond Yang Pass, you meet an old friend.", "Burn incense and pray with single mind. Fortune grows from the field of your own heart. Life span is already fixed in Heaven's ledger. Why labor in private rites for a cure?", "Household: peaceful; illness: quick recovery; pregnancy: a son; traveler: arrives soon; lawsuit: in the right; lost goods: recoverable; marriage: achievable; travel: auspicious; seeking office: certain success; seeking wealth: greatly fulfilled; crops and silkworms: abundant harvest; livestock: thriving; all affairs: greatly auspicious."],
    ["Slip 2", "Lower Middle", "Tiger Leaves the Forest", "The tiger leaves the deep wood and must stir the crowd. All who see it feel doubt and dread. Though it may not take a life, empty fright is clearly marked.", "Against Heaven's order you force a stand. Reckless deeds have always been the root of woe. A gentleman stays poor yet keeps the Way. Do not lose your reckoning and be deceived.", "Long you linger in a humble room, wishing for change. Yet this house lacks fortune's pulse. Brace for empty shocks and troubled dreams. Guard the young and watch against scheming women.", "At first meeting the face seems fair. Midway you find half of it untrue. If it is not true marriage, do not pair. Better let go and turn homeward.", "Only through earlier carelessness was wealth already lost—how seek it now? Wait until month's end on yin or shen days. Only then will a bystander bring word.", "Better dwell in peace and keep your luck. Do not pass through courts and take the whip. Leave others' meddling alone. Once sorrow comes, regret is late.", "Geese vanish, fish sink; news grows sparse. You gaze till white clouds blur the way. If you meet on yin or chen days, magpies cry at the eaves; horse and rider return.", "Illness caught in tumult finds ease in stillness. Do not treat it as an ordinary case. Vows still owed should be repaid early, lest heat accumulate and turn to chill of spleen.", "Body: unfit for going out; lost goods: hard to find; illness: make offerings; traveler: word comes but not yet arrived; seeking wealth: delayed; young ones: misfortune; pregnancy: difficult birth; lawsuit: settle by counsel; seeking office: not yet attained; marriage: hard to match; livestock and crops: half ripe."],
    ["Slip 3", "Great Auspicious", "From Extremity Comes Turn", "From extremity comes joy; fortune turns to peace. The Dragon Spring is polished clean of old dust. Do not believe that keeping to yourself brings nothing. Even behind closed doors, wealth may come.", "For years your tracks lay on rivers and lakes. Name and profit only now leave hardship's road. This day you meet a noble's aid. Behold spring color filling the imperial city.", "Do not fret that the household has long stagnated. Heaven's way is not partial toward any man. If you will change from former ways, grain and wealth will surpass common years.", "Fate arranges for those who have affinity. Do not sigh that mismatch brings no peace. Now listen well to qin and se in harmony. Let not night rain drip on empty steps.", "For years you panned for gold in sand. Only when it is lost do you know the wasted heart. Seeking now, it is hard to see. After the gen period, a knowing friend appears.", "Sudden calamity presses on the body. How can the wronged cry out and be heard? Yet gods protect from the empty air. The good will not be made a prisoner.", "You have crossed rivers and mountains ten thousandfold. Looking home, white clouds veil the view. Hidden merit has always sheltered you. You walk amid spring wind and gentle air.", "Harshness and cruelty invite fierce disaster. Reproach wastes the flesh thin as kindling. If you align with the Way and reform, the withered branch blooms leaves at once.", "Household and people: greatly favorable; illness: make offerings; lawsuit: in the right; seeking wealth: as wished; pregnancy: a son; seeking office: certain success; traveler: arrives at once; livestock: thriving; crops and silkworms: abundant; body: greatly auspicious; marriage: achievable."],
    ["Slip 4", "Lower Middle", "Toil Without Reward", "You toil with mind and strength, hoping for success. When flowers open, a gust of wind arrives. You must borrow gentle force from the eastern lord. In the distance another crimson branch awaits.", "All schemes are spent; the matter will not form. Ask no more of prospects for a while. Wait until the golden crow reaches kun and zhen. Then glory and renown will rise of themselves.", "Idle cares waste your support for nothing. Greedy heart spends effort and misses the moment. Loss of livestock is a lesser harm. Still guard against fright among the household.", "When marriage's day arrives, you need not seek. Why strain and waste the anxious mind? Intentional planting may not live, while casual willows grow into a grove.", "You suffered to dig after wealth. Who thought today would bring ash and ruin? Gain and loss, rich and poor, all rest on fate. Needless now to guess in wild confusion.", "From of old the stubborn learn by hard experience. Who knew that being in the right could still draw wrath? Official punishment may not yet fall. Why not settle privately and be a decent man?", "You left hoping to gather yellow gold. Looking back, the road home only deepens. Had you known people's hearts so soon, better never to have been so greedy.", "You thought each move was wondrous and true. You did not see greed as the root of woe. Empty passion wounds the body's core. Seek good forces early and keep free of doubt.", "Household and people: misfortune; heart unsettled by loss; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; lost goods: unseen—search urgently; traveler: not yet arrived; illness: serious; offerings for seeking office: not yet attained; pregnancy: fright; crops: half ripe; livestock: need protection; marriage: will not succeed; lawsuit: settle amicably."],
    ["Slip 5", "Great Auspicious", "Fair Winds for Sailing", "The ship sails with fair wind; no doubt remains. Crossing rivers and fords, you meet the right hour. A journey of ten thousand miles can be completed. Plans succeed and affairs arrive on schedule.", "If you seek to act, harbor no suspicion. Seeking name and profit, do not wait too late. When chance is convenient, go at once. Do not let luck and timing slip away.", "The household thrives; blessing gods are many. No misfortune among the people; all affairs are calm. Spring and summer bring slight regrets. Autumn and winter, joy arrives of itself.", "A century's marriage may form in a single day. Why labor today in bitter mediation? Both sides consent; nothing else remains. Go gladly and complete the betrothal.", "Yesterday a small boat crossed Dongting. Know that your heart is not at ease. Ordinary goods seem lost accordingly. In the end a trail appears; need not startle.", "Being in the right, why ask the Highest Truth? Even through the courts you draw no wrath. Though fear abounds for now, you are kept safe and all affairs extend.", "The return date presses; longing stretches long. Yet unfinished business holds you back. If blessing gods add their aid, a light sail and fair wind bring the boat to shore.", "Who knew disaster would come swift as wind? Even Lu Yi and Bian Que apply effort in vain. One sincere vow answered by Heaven and Earth adds years and makes an old man still.", "Household and people: greatly auspicious; seeking wealth: joyful; lost goods: recoverable; illness: gradually receding; traveler: about to arrive; lawsuit: in the right; marriage: achievable; crops and livestock: thriving; body: offerings bring good fortune; seeking office: certain success; pregnancy: a son; affairs: greatly auspicious."],
    ["Slip 6", "Most Inauspicious", "Mandarin Ducks Part", "Mandarin ducks are parted and fly two ways. Plans and profit have not yet found their hour. Keeping the old is fitting; reform is not. Advance and retreat still hang in doubt.", "Name and profit were never easy to obtain. Busy worldly cares are gulls upon the water. Heaven does not wish men to cling in greed. Floating clouds waste effort and whiten the hair in vain.", "You hoped this year for every matter's bloom. Who knew a trifle would invite calamity? If people and wealth are to be well again, renew incense vows to household gods and stove.", "Years and fates are not matched in harmony. Forced success will scarcely bring free flow. Even if affinity joins you for a while, parting east and west must come at last.", "Lost worldly goods—ask the sacred truth. Do not now rage against the crowd. Heaven's ledger marks each fraction fixed. Food and clothing come as sought without harm to life.", "Do not heed others' urging into the county court. Both sides only forge a feud for nothing. Better let go and leave in peace than cry for the magistrate before the steps.", "When leaving there were brothers many. Midway the company was lost. Delay that has not come will yet arrive. Why lean each day upon the brushwood gate?", "Wife asking of husband, husband of wife—all day one must keep lonely watch. Fathers, brothers, uncles asking of a man: though hardship sinks deep, still it can be healed.", "Household: quarrels and misfortune; lost goods: unseen; lawsuit: settle amicably; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; seeking office: not yet attained; illness: offer to household gods; traveler: not yet arrived; pregnancy: a daughter; crops: half ripe; livestock: keep auspicious; body: delayed; marriage: will not succeed."],
    ["Slip 7", "Upper Middle", "Withered Tree Meets Spring", "The withered tree meets spring and longs for bloom. Suddenly branches swell and buds appear. Let people not cut it down for firewood. Wait for deep spring and it flowers again.", "Long in the mountains you waited for good news. No one plucked you up to speak of feeling. Now you borrow force from the eastern wind. Leaves dense, flowers thick, shade covers the ground.", "Stagnation clears—worth praising now. A single blessing star shines on your house. From now heed no bystanders' talk. When the tree stands true, why fear the slanting sun?", "For years you sat long with none to call. Today the withered branch puts forth soft shoots. Marriage may join across a thousand miles. Without affinity, even face to face the road is far.", "Clearly lost goods lie toward the east. You search indoors in vain confusion. Delay three or five days more, and others will only talk with empty mouths.", "New matters wound; old matters settle. Do not show off high ability. A calm heart finds justice on the magistrate's seat. This ground has never been for climbing.", "Letters are promised to your house. Yet human feeling has not yet aligned. Wait until the three yangs turn the horse around. Suddenly brocade robes arrive at the gate.", "Without disaster you will not chant Amitabha. Only in illness do old vows weigh heavy. If you reform with all your heart, the good will not be shown to Yama.", "Household: young ones have misfortune; illness: make offerings; body: beware petty people; lost goods: search urgently; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; traveler: word arrives; seeking office: not yet attained; crops: half ripe; pregnancy: a son; livestock: keep auspicious; marriage: achievable."],
    ["Slip 8", "Most Inauspicious", "Fishing Boat Against the Shoal", "See the fishing boat pressing up the shoal. It moors here and hesitates a while. Past the front shoal, all seems clear. Yet further shoals ahead are harder still.", "When fate holds no hour, do not seek. Why day and night cast the fishing boat? The red-scaled fish lie only in autumn waves. All cunning will not bring them to the hook.", "Unable to keep your place, forever greedy, you draw household gods and many woes. Spring and summer: worry of illness among people. Autumn and winter: fear of ruined fields.", "Bystanders say the pair is well matched. Who can measure the tiger-wolf within the breast? A fair face does not mean a fair heart. Better sleep alone on the outer rattan couch.", "For small things you lost donkey and ox. The thought sits on the heart and frets all day. Human eyes see less than Heaven's. Clearly you are told: do not grasp in greed.", "Where peace can settle, let it settle. Everywhere hearts hold malice and deceit. Do not trust easy talk in wine. On the court platform, answering charges is hard.", "One heart hangs with worry at both ends. Roads blocked, the mind is not free. How many wrongs and bitter thoughts—yet no news reaches Yangzhou.", "A small matter vexes the heart and draws strange illness of doubt. Seek blessing swiftly in stillness. Do not let added reproach cast you to dust.", "Household and people: misfortune; body: guard against quarrels; illness: make offerings; lost goods: unseen; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; traveler: not yet arrived; lawsuit: not in the right; seeking office: not yet attained; crops: half ripe; pregnancy: difficult birth with empty fright; livestock: acceptable; marriage: hard to achieve if changed further."],
    ["Slip 9", "Average", "Spring Orchid, Autumn Chrysanthemum", "Orchid fragrance in spring is truly lovely. Chrysanthemum's clear scent is fair as well. Heaven and Earth each keep their own affection. They do not grasp the east wind's ordered bloom.", "Once you were promised arrival in spring. Who thought endeavor would not align? Wait for the months when chrysanthemum and plum open. Name and profit will both be whole again.", "You hoped for household peace and every success. Through the year, gloom has seldom lifted. Through discord you slighted household gods. The gate has none, yet voices turn toward it.", "If marriage forms, wait for the full moon. Need not hang suspense within the heart. Though the match is a fine affinity, the other side is not yet firm.", "Having lost it yourself, why blame old Heaven? The gods will not pity for mere wealth. If you would hear true news, not next year—the year after.", "I warn you: do not cling to bitter greed and wrath. Lest writs arrive for litigation. In all things draw back and go home. Close the door, sit still, and be a worthy person.", "Long gone, though letters are sparse, why now hesitate in doubt? Orchid and chrysanthemum each have their flowering day. Each waits upon its root and season.", "Here you languish, resentment filling the breast. Without good medicine, affairs will not align. Peace waits until after the third watch. Calamity departs and fortune descends.", "Household: guard young ones and women against misfortune; make offerings; lost goods: hard to find; illness: make offerings; seeking wealth: half fulfilled; traveler: has word; lawsuit: lingering, not yet resolved; pregnancy: not yet delivered; livestock: thriving; marriage: may join, but delayed."],
    ["Slip 10", "Most Inauspicious", "Bees Making Honey", "Whether on flat land or mountain peak, endless scenery is all claimed. After gathering a hundred flowers into honey, for whom the toil, for whom the sweet?", "Entrusting others with the heart's affairs, turn early and go home. Fair speech may hide an unfair heart. Foolish devotion only invites calamity.", "This year crops and silkworms are half auspicious. Summer and autumn, beware harm to cattle and sheep. Deep winter, protect the household with rites. Also fear the wicked entering walls by night.", "Do not lose yourself in idle wildflowers. Joy at its peak soon breeds sorrow. Gather the heart and wait on marriage. Do not draw bystanders' gossip.", "Lost wealth—do not blame Heaven. Who told the worthy one only to sleep greedily? Clearly it has entered others' hands, not by reed flowers in shallow water.", "Hardest in the world to quit are greed and wrath. The mantis laughs and does not see the moment. Fearing the cicada you would catch, you miss the yellow sparrow following behind.", "Hardship crosses ten thousand layered hills. The busy heart has not yet turned home. Fear also poison from people on the road. Much peril lies within the way.", "Fierce illness settles on the body with no help. Growing heavier, you face Yama. If you would have the baleful star retreat, swiftly invite a high monk to settle it at once.", "Household: guard against misfortune; body: peaceful; lost goods: unseen; guard against quarrels; seeking wealth: dissipating; traveler: not yet arrived; illness: serious—make offerings; lawsuit: unfinished; seeking office: not yet attained; pregnancy: a daughter; marriage: will not succeed; quarrels; crops: half ripe."],
    ["Slip 11", "Great Auspicious", "Prisoner Released", "The prisoner leaves jail; the suit is done. He buys sweet melon and mounts the wine loft. Meeting an old friend, they drink freely. Wine money paid, they toast again.", "Buried tracks had not yet prospered. Today you receive grace and thank the Highest Vault. Reform former faults and walk the great Way. Wealth and rank will then be easy and full.", "Horses thrive, people flourish; all is fitting. Crops and silkworms tenfold at autumn's term. Only guard against women and the young falling ill. Seeing joy without worry, do not deceive.", "Past-life affinity meets in this life. Do not raise love and hate over wealth. Where a noble lifts you up, climb the cassia toward the cloud layers.", "Do not blame the innocent with secret rebuke. Clearly it fell by the market bridge west. Now divine aid supports you. Lost goods still may not return complete.", "You have always feared law and officials. When matters reach the head, peril comes in rounds. A lofty person will watch with clear eyes. Need not fret and burden the heart.", "Years of parting, word comes to the gate. Today in a strange land you meet a known friend. Urge to return is urgent as river waves. Only the question: early or late arrival.", "Years just freed from the gate of right and wrong—who thought Heaven's disaster would stain the body again? If you seek no divine aid, lingering days will leave you trapped in dust.", "Household: increase of people; body: no trouble; lost goods: recoverable; illness: take medicine; seeking wealth: great gain; traveler: arrives at once; lawsuit: in the right; marriage: achievable; seeking office: gains the post; pregnancy: a son, delayed; crops: abundant; livestock: thriving; all affairs: greatly auspicious."],
    ["Slip 12", "Most Inauspicious", "Wind Scatters Willow Catkins", "Willow catkins wind-blown, no news remains—like King Xiang's dream. In night stillness, bright moon, and fine breeze, they drift empty and catch on fragrant clumps.", "Not following luck's season, you force wealth. Level the heart's ground and judge for yourself. If you act wrongly against propriety, you invite calamity and Heaven's disaster.", "Dangerous roads, a failing body, return at dusk. Guard carefully against present tumult and wrong. Young ones at home invite misfortune. Livestock and crops fall short this year.", "Without affinity, do not take charge of marriage. The two sides' years and fates scarce match. Matchmakers are men who deceive. Even if it forms, it will not last.", "It was never your own wealth. Why chatter and guess with intent? Do not think broken wealth and lost capital—even finding it invites disaster.", "Sudden trouble comes without warning. When will the gloom within the heart open? Better now seek peace than quarrel, lest you carry coin to the magistrate's seat.", "Fish sink, crows vanish, gone without a trace. Weary travel, blocked roads, no passage through. Ten thousand miles from home, return is denied. Looking back at Yang Pass, white clouds thicken.", "Dreams enter the dark realm; the road is already far. Casting yourself on gods only draws empty sighs. Fallen flowers intend to follow flowing water. Flowing water has no feeling to cling to fallen flowers.", "Household: unfavorable; women and young ones: unforeseen misfortune; illness: ominous—protect with offerings; seeking wealth: none; traveler: not yet arrived; lawsuit: settle by counsel; seeking office: not yet attained; crops: half ripe; pregnancy: difficult birth; marriage: will not succeed; livestock: protect for safety."],
    ["Slip 13", "Great Auspicious", "Blossom Bears Fruit", "Blossom bears fruit and meets its joyful hour. Relying on spring's craft and creation's loom. All you hope and plan succeeds as wished. Broading homeward, the matter can be dated.", "Jade flesh and ice skin will not shift. True heart is known only in the year's cold. Now glad that warmth of yang arrives. Flowers fall, yet fruit still fills the branches.", "This year is not last year's poverty. Treasure renews; you meet honored guests. The household is complete, no thieves. Peace surpasses people of the nine provinces.", "Her beauty and his talent are rare in the world. Former affinity is fixed; need not doubt. Now if the other only consents, take coin and pass the appointed day.", "Floating wealth is lost—ask who took it. Do not scrutinize the innocent too closely. You sit facing truly toward the west. Originally the thing lies in the east.", "Lesser folk stir up unfinished matters. Need not now startle the heart. The hall has a true bright mirror. Right and wrong bring no disaster, no cane.", "The traveler's heart is urgent, the mind wavers. Blocked roads still hold him from return. From yin-mao waiting into chen-si days, still on flat ground a clap of thunder.", "Heaven's stars are unaligned and bring offense. Illness of the body does not shorten years. If you meet a clear teacher or false speech, better pray for blessing and thank blue Heaven.", "Household: steady; body: greatly favorable; lost goods: recoverable; illness: recovers; seeking office: gains the post; traveler: arrives soon; lawsuit: in the right; seeking wealth: as wished; pregnancy: a son; crops: abundant; marriage: achievable; household grows; livestock: thriving."],
    ["Slip 14", "Average", "Dragon and Snake Entwined", "Dragon and snake entwined are hardest to tell apart. Not yet have wind and thunder changed the scales. One day it rises and returns to the northern sea. Only then will the dragon spirit show.", "Matters at both ends still idle and slip. Better follow affinity and keep your place. When the hour comes it will not be long. What you seize before your eyes will also fade.", "Without incense or self-cultivation you ask of household matters still unresolved. If wealth and people are to thrive, first settle the old household gods in peace.", "Secret marriage unknown to the crowd loses blessing, breaks order; regret comes late. If not harmed by force of others, still the courts may bring the whip.", "Lost floating wealth—do not weep poverty. Seeking now cannot be followed. Wait until cold wind and frost arrive. Then bystanders will speak the true trail.", "Human and ghost affairs cross; seek settlement. Hard to tell right from wrong amid the rush. Better endure and quench the heart's fire than let the whole body suffer torment.", "The traveler left and has not come home. Companions share linked sighs of blame. To see him, wait for ren or gui days. Then the old friend first leaves the world's edge.", "Jade and stone are hard to tell false from true. Yin and yang, cold and heat, not yet even. Early burn a stove of heart's incense. Lest the living become as the dead.", "Household and people: unsettled; body: unfit for travel; lost goods: hard to find; illness: stars unaligned; crops: half harvest; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; traveler: not yet arrived; marriage: hard to achieve; quarrels and lawsuit: not in the right; seeking office: not yet attained; pregnancy: anxious doubt; livestock: changeable."],
    ["Slip 15", "Supreme Auspicious", "A Full Bright Moon", "The moon is full tonight beyond the plum. People look up in awe to the fair blue sky. Where clear light flashes, the throng of stars scatters. A gentleman's plans will gain office at once.", "Going forth you meet an honored guest's invitation. Do not sigh that Heaven's road is far. On flat ground pursue your aims as you will. Clouds hold Heaven's ladder and bridges over water.", "Keep the body safe; ask not of money. Burn good incense at the stove and thank blue Heaven. Crops, silkworms, livestock all thrive. This year is sure to surpass the last.", "Past life fixed this marriage bond. Her beauty, his talent, both still young. Hold firm and answer Heaven and Earth. Husband and wife will surely reunite.", "The trail of lost goods passed the northern wing. Do not now thrash about in wild guessing. Tomorrow a bystander will see of himself. Rely on the gods to keep good fortune.", "You are by nature a clever, accomplished person. Chance stagnation only drains the spirit. Clouds gather, rain scatters; midnight stills. The toad-light of the moon shines over four seas.", "When leaving you agreed to meet soon. Today letters again do not connect. Blocked and delayed three or five days. Wealth will be ample and the season rich.", "Something weighs within; intention hard to carry. If done, a gentleman will know. Good wealth is hard to part with. Part with it, and calamity goes as fortune follows.", "Household: steady; body: greatly auspicious; lost goods: not truly lost; illness: no harm; offerings keep fortune; seeking wealth: as wished; traveler: arrives at once; lawsuit: in the right; seeking office: certain success; pregnancy: a son; marriage: soon achieved; crops and livestock: thriving; all affairs: greatly auspicious."],
    ["Slip 16", "Most Inauspicious", "Lamp Lit with Muddy Oil", "Muddy oil lights a lamp that dies easily. Just trimmed up, it fades again. Long wick burned through, effort wasted empty. Why not withdraw early and go home?", "Walking danger and fording water—hardship twice. Ten thousand schemes make name and profit strange. Keep your place, endure poverty, bear patiently. Busy toil is not as good as ease.", "Only because you would not honor the gods, household affairs have no peace. To remove this year's disaster and woe, first renew and lift the household gods.", "Barely spoken of, already they draw back. This marriage will not reach its end. Now slight words of consent appear, yet fear others scheme in secret.", "Sudden loss of wealth—do not rage at once. Broaden the breast; do not blame others. Returning, ponder within the heart. Broken floating wealth may spare the body harm.", "In all things nothing surpasses earnest truth. Why speak bitterly of hardship? Better turn back early. Arriving there, beware ghosts that toy with men.", "Body weak, strength failing, the road is hard. Home is near as a foot, yet far as ten thousand miles. Seek good blessing upon the Way. Lest wind and rain send autumn's sound.", "In peril do not waste wealth in vain. Flowing water has no feeling and does not return. A half-spent remnant lamp's light about to die meets another fierce gust of wind.", "Household: unsettled; body: keep to the old ways; lost goods: unseen; lawsuit: not in the right; illness: ominous; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; marriage: will not succeed; pregnancy: a son with worry; livestock: losses; traveler: beware thieves; all affairs: unfavorable."],
    ["Slip 17", "Average", "Worry Without Cause", "What once succeeded turns to loss. Today's perilous worry is not peril. If you meet a noble who guides and receives, the thousand-year withered tree grows branches again.", "Greed for more only draws disaster to the body. Name and profit were never truly real. Better ease and household joy. Who among them is a person of a hundred years?", "Do not take strange dreams as idle sorrow. Heed no crooked teachers and invite no woe. Your conduct already aligns with Heaven's way. How should slight peril leave illness hard to clear?", "Need not force matters for funding gold. When marriage's luck arrives, why seek? Rushing to form is not a good thing. You know the face, not the heart.", "Only through laziness it was not stored. When lost, a hiding place already waited. Seek early with intent and it is easy to see. Delay three days and it goes west.", "Burn incense and pray with focused spirit. Asking of official disaster, the matter will not form. A noble will lift you with force. Tiger's head and snake's tail—need not startle.", "Need not ask others for news. The traveler abroad already holds a heart of return. Though goods are few or many, arriving safe is worth ten thousand gold.", "Disaster came not of your own making. Why burn coin toward ghosts? Only keep a level heart answering Heaven and Earth. Still and steady, pass the cold tide.", "Household: women and young ones have misfortune; illness: no harm; seeking wealth: half fulfilled; traveler: not yet arrived; body: keep to the old; seeking office: certain success; lawsuit: slow but auspicious; pregnancy: a son; crops: abundant; marriage: delayed but auspicious."],
    ["Slip 18", "Most Inauspicious", "Cage Opens, Crane Flies", "I raised you through deep years. Cage opens; you are gone—the mind sinks in thought. Likely only on the autumn river. Bright moon and reed flowers—where to seek?", "You had no share to become an immortal. Loving birds, you covered them in cages. Unfit that they escape beyond the sky. Only then know greed becomes all empty.", "Last year unfavorable, losses many. Why this year still unsettled? Livestock and crops not even doubled. Further worry of fire and thieves.", "Marriage promised in the heart without knowing wrong. How good to chase delight and bring you home? Watch and know the geese within the grove. At fifth watch dawn they each fly apart.", "In idle times the fence was not repaired. Lost floating wealth only adds more worry. Goods already fallen empty and dissolved. Where now to seek the trail?", "On the three offices' platform you first know wrong. Within prison walls, regret comes late. If imperial grace and Heaven's pardon arrive, the jail opens and the guilty return.", "Name and profit stumble; the mind wanders. Body blocked in a strange land, return not ready. Gaze breaks on the long river with no news. Then know Bao Lao sends the infant.", "Heaven's stars unaligned; illness hard to ease. Each day you languish, the old face changes. Medicine and gods bring no response. Heart-vows promised—better not delay.", "Household: unsettled; body: loss; lost goods: unseen; women and young: misfortune; seeking wealth: none; traveler: not yet arrived; pregnancy: a son; lawsuit: not in the right; seeking office: not yet attained; travel: unfavorable; crops: half ripe; livestock: losses; illness: stars unaligned; old vows unpaid."],
    ["Slip 19", "Great Auspicious", "Clouds Move, Rain Falls", "Clouds move, rain falls; spring is deep. Plans and profit all succeed as wished. Disputes before officials often find you right. Nobles' joy seeks you of itself.", "The season meets warm law and peaceful scenes. Plans and profit all succeed as wished. If you would act, do it in this hour. Change dress, leave the old, and take merit and name.", "Spring plow, summer plant, then autumn harvest. People's affairs are peaceful; need not worry. Leave early and carefully. Guard against lesser folk stirring without cause.", "Returning home, set the bridal chamber in order. Listen well—phoenix song within the sounding qin. Heaven grants marriage still more harmonious. You need not now ask of prospects.", "Advised to change, you would not follow. Lost goods—ask gods of good and ill. At zi and wu directions, where people thrive, carefully inquire the coming trail.", "Do not trust others' long and short talk. Though you seem to lose the right, you still stand strong. If officials and nobles add slight force, like sunlight—greatly auspicious.", "Long dwelling in a strange land, not yet home. Chance wandering at the world's edge. One morning you meet the dragon walking rain. The withered tree again fills with flowers.", "Coming like wind and rain, leaving like fine dust. The sick still languish, not yet awake. Better repay heart-vows early. Lest illness bitterly entangle the body.", "Household: guard against loss; body: auspicious; lost goods: search urgently; traveler: has word; seeking wealth: as wished; lawsuit: in the right; marriage: achievable; pregnancy: a son; livestock: thriving; crops and silkworms: greatly auspicious."],
    ["Slip 20", "Most Inauspicious", "Boat Without Oars", "A boat without oars can scarcely carry. Further drifted toward the sea's midst. Sigh that worldly folk are never content. Thus misled, they rush east and west.", "Ten thousand schemes, matters hard to form. Wasted travel across a thousand mountain passes. Better gather the heart and endure. Else the master of affairs turns to alarm.", "Last year hoped this year would be good. Why is this year still unsettled? Only because old matters hold much strangeness. Suspicion then harms human feeling.", "Promised—why then not the same? Only that years and fates do not match. Do not force an unsettled heart. Fear also that meeting is only in a dream.", "In idle times you would not carefully guard. Lost—how busy yourself in empty haste? Trails in mountain streams cannot be found. Do not think news lies beside someone.", "Official matters have always been best advised open. Though strange and in the right, need not come. Do not let formed affairs become hard to avoid. Fear lingering to the magistrate's seat.", "Body harmed only for the sake of wealth. Bound in a strange land, not yet returned. Traveler on the road, beware official trouble. At home still worry of fire and thieves.", "A broken boat crosses the sea and meets wind again. Lost oars meet peril in the midst of danger. Divination and physicians are all vain. Better swiftly knock on hidden merit.", "Household and people: misfortune; body: quarrels; lost goods: unseen; illness: hard to recover, ominous; traveler: not yet arrived; lawsuit: settle amicably; seeking office: not yet attained; marriage: regret and reversal; pregnancy: a daughter; crops: half harvest; livestock: misfortune."],
    ["Slip 21", "Great Auspicious", "Kun Becomes Peng", "Kun becomes Peng; sea waves turn. Yin and yang join in a peaceful interval. Ordinary folk suddenly hold cloud-soaring will. Thunder on flat ground opens the buried return.", "Years adrift within the waves. Not yet had wind and thunder raise the spirit high. Today freed, transformation just begins. Know that ten thousand miles are yours to roam.", "Best renew the old gate and court beforehand. Horses thrive, people flourish; all is peaceful. Not only crops tenfold—further, trade freely in all four directions.", "Young man and young woman suit each other well. Matching marriage presses like fire. Now seek the phoenix pair. Delay and miss it; regret comes late.", "Northeastward, water roads run. The trail is found; the thing returns to life. Do not be idle with many doubts. Wealth scatters, people part; change awaits.", "At first the heart still doubts alone. In the end clear depths show the stone bank. A noble will add strength at last. The net will not cover the whale.", "Long no fish or goose of news. Family frets and seeks within their dreams. Before Heaven's honored hall, pray with sincere heart. At once the traveler appears at the gate.", "Seven passions wound the body and invite disaster. Both brows knit; gloom will not open. Make offerings, pray for protection. Lest kin rise in mourning.", "Household: increase of people; body: greatly auspicious—renewal fitting; illness: offerings bring recovery; seeking wealth: as wished; traveler: arrives at once; lawsuit: in the right; seeking office: certain success; marriage: achievable; pregnancy: a son; crops: abundant; livestock: thriving; all affairs: greatly auspicious."],
    ["Slip 22", "Supreme Auspicious", "Phoenix Leaves the Grove", "The phoenix flies out from among the trees. Spreading wings it comes, unlike common birds. One day honored, it courts the upper palace. All who hear the name look up in envy.", "Years of quiet sitting in idle dwelling. Scenes bleak, the household empty. Going forth, luck opens and fortune turns. Name and profit seek you of themselves.", "Best arrange a new nest for the old. Far from the petty throng, avoid their mockery. In harmony, no trouble—peace is blessing. With ripe years, how can you fall behind?", "A century's couple is like sounding qin. In stillness listen well to phoenix song. Do not let good marriage miss its appointed road. Wait till cold Heaven loses the goose flock.", "Only because you lacked covering yourself. Lost—how then return of its own? Must pass through courts to see it. Do not let later days leave you cheated.", "For plumage's sake you cherished the red robe. Hate entered the deep grove, bullied by magpies. Today you rise and soar the blue expanse. Let rats and magpies sneer whenever they will.", "The one who left, returning, packs in haste. Leaving the strange land beside the road. In the last ten days of ox or horse, news arrives. Safe and well—need not hurry.", "Years of stagnation; luck not yet open. A baleful star shines straight on your gate. Who knew the vault of Heaven would aid? Kept whole, recover, and thank the Highest Vault.", "Household and people: peaceful; body: make offerings; lawsuit: in the right; seeking office: certain success; seeking wealth: half fulfilled; marriage: hard to achieve; crops: abundant; pregnancy: a son; illness: recovers; livestock: thriving."],
    ["Slip 23", "Most Inauspicious", "Blossoms Meet the Rain", "You planted peach trees filling the eastern court. Flowers open, then meet rain and wind. At first you hoped to gather peaches. Arriving now, only emptiness remains.", "Years seeking to break cassia in the toad palace. Season unmet, you return empty. Who thought waiting for the flowering day would meet continuous heavy rain?", "The old dwelling is unfavorable; move toward the new. Unwilling to move, you cannot find peace. All matters at this house—people's strength is thin. In spring's heart, beware petty folk at work.", "Seeing a fair face, not knowing the heart. Wasted good matchmakers and ten thousand gold. For present joy shared together, who knew woe would rise from lust?", "Why chatter and guess with intent? Clearly it is not your own wealth. Rely on Heaven's way to seek peace. Injustice has always been the womb of woe.", "Sudden trouble at the gate—how can you advance? Guard the young against knives in smiles. Delay and refuse peaceful settlement; in the end entanglement reaches the official jail.", "Passes and mountains stretch; the road is hard. The traveler left and has not returned. Better cultivate good fortune before the gods. Lest the body enter the ghost gate.", "True illness has never had a recipe. Do not wait till it grows heavy, then panic. If you do not seek Heaven's aid, the old linger and the young perish.", "Household: women and young ones have misfortune; body: guard against quarrels; lost goods: unseen; illness: make offerings; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; traveler: not yet arrived; lawsuit: not in the right; seeking office: not yet attained; marriage: will not succeed; crops: half ripe; livestock: losses; traveler: unfavorable; pregnancy: a son."],
    ["Slip 24", "Great Auspicious", "Bright Moon Overhead", "Bright moon overhead shines everywhere. Clear radiance breaks through confusion. Plans prosper; the household is auspicious. This day glory arrives right on time.", "The heart desires quiet; affairs are not idle. Missing the hour, nowhere to settle the body. Now you gain the road of blue clouds. Need no Heaven's ladder to step into Guanghan.", "Your house has no trouble; need not doubt. How can night dreams hold fixed dates? Kin are at ease with no other cares. Guard against petty folk deceiving in the dark.", "Marriage by nature tends toward reunion. Need not hurry with suspense in the heart. When affinity's meeting day arrives, man and woman will surely be complete.", "By now it has reached another's side. Do not wrong the innocent as thieves. Trails have directions; in time they appear. Though seen, it may be hard to make whole.", "Dragon and tiger meet; affairs have beauty. One round bright moon lights the world's edge. Jade and stone already sorted—need not worry. Need not let the heart tangle like silk.", "The awaited traveler seems before the eyes. Why does return still delay? To know what day letters arrive: when the bright moon rounds, people reunite of themselves.", "Calamity and fortune have never had a gate. All are invited by people; need not debate. Better bow in thanks beneath the open day. Let not night moon shine on a lonely soul.", "Household: loss; body: quiet keeping of the old is auspicious; lost goods: unseen; illness: make offerings; seeking wealth: gain; traveler: word arrives; lawsuit: in the right; seeking office: certain success; pregnancy: a son; marriage: auspicious but delayed; livestock and crops: abundant; all affairs: greatly auspicious."],
    ["Slip 25", "Lower-Middle", "Plans Unfulfilled", "Plans unfulfilled as you intended. Gazing toward blue clouds, the road grows farther. Better keep to the old—that is auspicious. In another time you will surely see glory.", "Luck not yet open—do not force seeking. What you seize before the eyes becomes worry too. Better keep the old and pass as you can. Glory waits in the autumn yet to come.", "Right and wrong pile up, empty fright rises. Livestock decline; a hundred strange things stir. If you wish for glory against the grain, guard against bandits entering the gate.", "This match is fine, yet you have no affinity. Do not lose yourself and invite offense. Reform and wait until affinity arrives. Late or early—only keep the heart firm.", "Seeking trails everywhere, few know. Better turn back and wait a while. Wait until month's end on shen or you days. Then know lost goods at that very hour.", "If seeking action and use, need not come. Keeping your place approximately may spare disaster. Lawsuit settled amicably is auspicious. Both houses then free of hanging worry.", "Last year steady—need not doubt. Only for wealth, what was seen came late. Asking what day return arrives: tiger's head and snake's tail report to you.", "From of old, people living to seventy are rare. Seeking name and profit stains with peril. Bloom and wither, long and short, all predestined. Keeping the body whole still costs the skin.", "Household: loss; people: misfortune; body: keep to the old; illness: serious; lost goods: unseen; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; lawsuit: settle by counsel; seeking office: not yet attained; marriage: will not succeed; crops: half ripe; livestock: losses; pregnancy: a daughter; traveler: not yet arrived."],
    ["Slip 26", "Great Auspicious", "Peaceful Dwelling Thrives", "Peaceful dwelling thrives; money advances. Clouds rise in Heaven; thunder shakes the earth. Rank and salary rise high in clear success. Glory and wealth enter at the gate.", "When luck arrives, need not leave for distant lands. Treasure gathers of itself beside you. Name and profit need not follow others' desires. Laugh that floating life busies itself in vain.", "Honor the gods as if present; the blessed rejoice. Dwelling bright; all affairs at peace. Not only crops all thrive—fire and thieves do not concern you.", "Meeting marriage's affinity, what need of a matchmaker? Having the heart, why rush so urgently? Not that you can meet only today. Five hundred years ago the bond was tied.", "East-west small paths, an old household there. The trail of loss is hidden in that place. Dead things still become living things. Need not resent and draw empty sighs.", "Nobles respond; the matter does not concern you. Harmonious air melts into one round. Better withdraw and go home. Let their cunning take a hundred thousand turns.", "Fine horse, long road—tighten the whip. In three mornings and two days, approach the origin. In the capital be a carefree guest. One sheet of news descends from nine heavens.", "The baleful star has retreated; illness will recover. All was ancestors' making of offense. One sincere stick of incense sends the memorial through. Suddenly long illness leaves the body free.", "Household: guard against petty folk's tricks; body: no trouble; lost goods: will be seen; seeking wealth: changeable; traveler: arrives soon; lawsuit: gains the right; seeking office: certain success; illness: no harm; pregnancy: a son; marriage: achievable; crops: abundant; livestock: thriving; all affairs: greatly auspicious."],
    ["Slip 27", "Most Inauspicious", "Household in Alarm", "The household trembles; the master has no peace. Because ancestors wrought disaster's trail. Better make offerings and seek deliverance. Further thank the household's worshipped gods.", "Wasted greedy heart confuses and clings. Not keeping place, you force action. One morning woe rises within the walls. Catch the hawk—the magpie has already flown.", "Ominous night dreams make empty fright. Chickens and dogs cry strangely without cause. Not that household gods alone send woe. Only because old departed souls go unhonored.", "From of old, marriage chooses three halls. Rushing to form is scarcely good. Without thrice thinking, without settled will, later regret hard, disaster follows.", "Household gods not thriving invite wrongful disaster. Lost—how is it your wealth? Do not think only your luck clumsy. Need not confuse the heart with wild guessing.", "Though the matter has reason, seeing officials is late. Without private settlement there will be dispute. Reaching the hall, hard to free yourself. Writs reverse and grow still harder.", "After leaving, three kinds of unfreedom. The gate is desolate as autumn cold. The traveler gone with no news. Wait until spring—need not yet worry.", "Fate adverse, the hour awry, placed in right and wrong. Why at crisis cry to gods? Better repay heart-vows early. Do not betray the promise made at first.", "Household and self: guard against quarrels; lost goods: unseen; illness: heavy; seeking wealth: none; lawsuit: not in the right; seeking office: not yet attained; traveler: not yet arrived; pregnancy: a daughter with misfortune; marriage: will not succeed; crops and livestock: misfortune—beware thieves."],
    ["Slip 28", "Supreme Auspicious", "Noble Patron Guides", "A noble guides; joy renews. Quarrels and official disaster stay far from the court. The sick from now grow strong in body. Seeking wealth and plans all prosper.", "Houses that accumulate good have surplus celebration. The auspicious naturally have blessing stars follow. Plans must follow Heaven's way. Even fierce peril is swept away.", "Do not raise doubt over the year's affairs. Though floating clouds, no one darkens. Not only people and wealth both thrive—fire and thieves do not invade.", "Good friends face to face speak knowing words. Moon bright, stars shine, wine's flavor pure. Now listen well to qin and se. Do not miss the coming of spring.", "Northeastward an ancient road connects. Meeting people, better ask the news. Do not now refuse labor. Seek carefully with the eyes—it will not fall empty.", "Need not submit petitions; the matter already opens. One round of harmonious air enters the gate. Seeing officials, you finally receive official force. Why fret over distant disaster?", "Asking when the traveler returns: wait further three-and-three, five-and-five terms. If you meet a noble's supporting strength, need not fret and fear peril.", "Doing good cultivates causes of former destinies. Your house's hidden virtue answers blue Heaven. Heaven's physician has spirit elixirs. Slight delay—illness will recover.", "Household and people: auspicious; self: peaceful; lost goods: not lost; traveler: halfway; lawsuit: peaceful; seeking wealth: certain success; pregnancy: a son; marriage: harmonious; seeking office: certain success; illness: recovers; crops: abundant; livestock: increase."],
    ["Slip 29", "Great Auspicious", "Yin and Yang United", "Yin and yang's ways unite; affairs prosper. Like a person walking within the moon. Qin and se in harmony; the gate is auspicious. Wealth and glory—all affairs thrive.", "Ten years of hard study by the lamp. Suddenly you turn and enter the examination hall. Glad that the court employs worthy scholars. Now your name is fragrant in Heaven's office.", "Honoring gods answers Heaven's heart. Gods glad, people joyful; woe does not invade. Slight yearly delay has no hanging care. Crops tenfold in deep autumn.", "The red cord binds feet, marking former affinity. Need not scheme—the matter is already formed. Deep moonlit night among silk bamboos. In stillness listen well to phoenix song.", "Though lost goods' road is already far, not sunk in deep captivity without shore. Seek urgently; gods are present. Fear not a thousand layers of fence.", "You are among people the most auspicious. Why act wildly and drain the spirit? Open virtue is less than hidden virtue. Empty teaching to the end does not touch the body.", "Layered passes, rugged roads. The traveler's worried heart hangs at both ends. Today's peril all disperses. Suddenly the urge to return reaches the gate.", "Heaven's disasters are numbered; not by people. Why chatter and offend the gods? When the baleful star's day is full, the body thrives again with lasting spirit.", "Household and people: peaceful; lost goods: search urgently; illness: protective rites—no harm; first ominous then auspicious; traveler: arrives; seeking wealth: half fulfilled; seeking office: certain success; lawsuit: will not form; marriage: succeeds; pregnancy: a son; crops and livestock: thriving."],
    ["Slip 30", "Most Inauspicious", "Moon Veiled by Clouds", "Just as flowers open, they meet night rain. Just as the moon is bright, clouds veil it. Tell peach and plum not to laugh. One day clouds open—there will be a time.", "Who in the world matches your cleverness? Yet the hour is adverse; matters do not form. Stay by the lamp and complete old studies. After autumn, ask again of merit and name.", "Having a heart for fasting, better not open. Lest wrongful disaster and sudden woe arrive. Returning, still cultivate right fruit. Lest kin rise in mourning.", "Former marriage pair was affinity by nature. Yet bystanders' chaotic talk confused it. Seeking today, hard to achieve. Better go home and wait in delay.", "The mindful calculate against the mindless. Lost wealth—yet you ask the gods. Trails exist in time and stay. Need not rage and draw others' wrath.", "Originally no matter—you invited wrongful disaster. Only because others brought it forth. Reaching the hall, hard to straighten the right. Better privately counsel peace and open it.", "Left for a strange land, not yet home. Both ends' thoughts tangle like silk. Who teaches clouds to scatter and toad-light appear? Then see people and wealth free of sighs.", "Illness already on the body—hard to cast off. Seeking physicians brings no effect; the face declines. Know that old vows should first be repaid. Then spare lingering on pillow and mat.", "Household: only keep to the old with caution; lost goods; guard against quarrels; illness: make offerings; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; traveler: not yet arrived; lawsuit: not in the right; marriage: hard to achieve; pregnancy: a daughter; seeking office: not yet attained; crops: half ripe; livestock: losses; runaways: hard to find."],
    ["Slip 31", "Average", "Restless Heart", "The heart's affairs surge, never of one mind. Seated, the body is safe yet not safe. All you do and seek remains unfulfilled. Like the bright moon barred by clouds.", "Within yourself the mind is flustered. Yet others' hearts are not yet busy. Wealth like mountains is all allotted. Keep to the old and wait upon the hour.", "Why does your house raise mourning? North and south directions offend and rise. Thank blessing gods and change for the better. Else how open the knitted brow?", "Flowery words and clever speech—is that true feeling? Wandering butterflies and wild wind are not to be approached. If you doubt, look at things in the garden. One round of wind and rain, and hearts shift.", "Lost now—you busy yourself in vain. Casually you would not carefully guard. To know where the trail returns, wait for mid-month night moonlight.", "Matters at the heart cut like a knife. Better endure; do not force the handle. Let carriages and horses turn in circles. Though the position seems to win, the play is not high.", "Asking of the traveler—not yet returned. Return dates still barred by layered hills. Whip a lean horse onto the road. Only because fine threads of noble connection pull.", "The household has no gods; ghost afflictions many. The sick are dazed; intention slips. If you would have the body strong and well, you must part with wealth at once.", "Household and people: peaceful; lost goods: unseen; illness: protective rites; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; traveler: not yet arrived; lawsuit: lingering; seeking office: not yet attained; marriage: hard to match; pregnancy: difficult birth; crops: half harvest; livestock: keep auspicious."],
    ["Slip 32", "Most Inauspicious", "Stars Invade the Moon", "Stars invade the moon—affairs need guarding. Young ones meet disaster; woe is marked. The sick who perform rites can reduce by half. Sincerely pray for blessing and thank the vault of Heaven.", "From of old, name, profit, and the arts of war—many scheme, few obtain. Better gather the heart and endure. Else lose the reckoning and be deceived.", "Women of the house meet frequent misfortune—how so? Only because household ghosts are many. If you would have peaceful days, you must find monks to honor Bodhidharma.", "Originally the marriage pair could reunite. Yet bystanders raise the tip of woe. If the matter is to form, act swiftly. Else delay and keep lonely cold.", "Clearly lost goods lie in the east. Many know, yet will not speak. If money is hard to see, even kin taste sour and salt.", "Lesser folk stir right and wrong without cause. Being in the right turns instead to loss. Now settle peacefully early. Do not wait for entanglement into prison.", "Leaving was swift; return is slow. Why delay until this hour? Midway the body meets obstruction. Early seek vast fortune to protect from peril.", "Stars unaligned; woe settles on the body. Do not wait lingering till bones steam. Early rites can still cast disaster off. Lest kin raise mourning.", "Household and people: inauspicious; body: guard against quarrels; lost goods: unseen; illness: heavy; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; traveler: not yet arrived; lawsuit: not in the right; seeking office: not yet attained; pregnancy: inauspicious; marriage: greatly broken; crops: half harvest; livestock: losses; people: make offerings and protective rites."],
    ["Slip 33", "Great Auspicious", "Dragon Sword Unsheathed", "Newly polished dragon sword—swift its edge. Rising to thrust at the Ox—who dares face it? Further, carried now in hand, heroic fierceness doubles the common measure.", "Not yet meeting Lei Huan to return it to the deep. A hundred temperings, a thousand grindings, bitter ordeal. This will knows a day to become the dragon. Lofty horns rise into blue Heaven.", "A splendid dwelling newly changed; harvest just gathered. Again spring's term fills the fields. Planting will surely yield tenfold. Further, officials and nobles settle affairs in harmony.", "From of old marriage is never chance. With affinity, even ten thousand miles transmit. Now is the time to cultivate the marriage bond. Do not send the pipa onto another's parting boat.", "Temporary loss—need not startle with worry. Hurry home and plan the later search. Northwestward where the road goes out, someone face to face will speak the trail.", "Others raise a matter that chances to touch you. Why suspect and sort right from wrong? A lofty person will speak justice. The good will not suffer punishment's loss.", "Sword from the bronze case—swift as a point. The traveler is already midway on the road. Meeting zi or wu, the return date arrives. Need not fret over ten thousand layered passes.", "Skin grows thin; bones remain firm. Each day you languish, not yet recovered. Only keep a heart of loyalty and filial piety. Why worry that small illness shortens Heaven's years?", "Household and people: peaceful; body: first quarrels; lost goods: search urgently—later found; seeking wealth: as wished; traveler: arrives soon; lawsuit: in the right; seeking office: certain success; marriage: achievable; pregnancy: a son; crops: abundant; livestock: thriving; illness: protective rites."],
    ["Slip 34", "Most Inauspicious", "Ailing Dragon Brings Rain", "The ailing dragon brings rain, fearing the rainbow. Illness of the body—affairs are unfit. Transformation and rising will have their day. For now keep to the old and wait the clear hour.", "Spring thunder not yet moved; force is weak. Quietly on flat ground wind and thunder rise. Though you have hands to seize the clouds, cleverness turns instead to clumsiness.", "Strange dreams frequent; the heart below worries. Why do complaints harm donkey and ox? You know only your own desires. You do not think of ancestors sunk in the nine darks.", "Marriage's one matter waits in autumn. Do not trust bystanders turning things upside down. If you would break wildflowers to look at yourself, do not take them for twin-headed lotuses.", "House lacking, gate declining; woe arrives. Wealth lost is then hard to find. To know where the trail returns: only before the hills and among the trees.", "Lawsuit from peace is better ended. Do not make yourself a jail's prisoner. I urge you to measure the heart a while. Losing a little—what fault is that?", "When leaving you agreed to return soon. Waiting till now, night moon wanes. On the road there is disaster—make offerings. Kept safe, then leave ten thousand layered hills.", "Affairs wound the body; disaster comes. Affliction at the gate will not be sent away. To be well, seek gods and repay old vows. Lest kin rise in mourning.", "Household and people: misfortune; lost goods: hard to find; illness: protective offerings; old vows unpaid; seeking wealth: slight profit; traveler: not yet arrived; lawsuit: lingering; pregnancy: difficult birth; crops: half ripe; seeking office: not yet attained; marriage: will not succeed; livestock: misfortune."],
    ["Slip 35", "Great Auspicious", "Crane Calls Across the Sky", "The crane calls across the vault; qi thrusts Heaven. Ninety thousand miles of road within a foot. Rank rises daily; wealth and salary advance. Dwell in peace and auspicious celebration through the years.", "Years beneath the pines, cherishing plumage. Unwilling to bow and visit the rich and powerful. Today you rise and soar the blue expanse. Only then know the will is high as Heaven.", "Magpies before the eaves cry often. They report: this year all affairs are peaceful. Not only crops tenfold—further the gate and court shine bright.", "The immortal crane among pines is lonely by nature. Chang'e in the moon—has she a husband? If you seek a mandarin-duck pair, wait till spring color fills the imperial city.", "Who thought one loss would make the road so far? Dead or living—still not yet clear. Again ask Heaven's gods for hidden aid. Then know the trail lies by steps and bridge.", "I charge you earnestly: need not worry. Suit reaches the hall; you are not free. Luckily a lofty person applies force in person. No name need reach the imperial province.", "Thinking far, a family letter is worth ten thousand gold. Today I tell you: set the heart at ease. The journey is far, yet home is near. Outside the gate horses neigh; the person arrives of himself.", "Disaster came originally toward the western heaven. You have hidden merit still able to extend. Fear not heavy killing spirits of the directions. Now only keep the vowing heart firm.", "Household and people: auspicious; self: no trouble; lost goods: recoverable; seeking wealth: fulfilled; illness: dazed and serious; traveler: arrives at once; lawsuit: in the right; seeking office: gains the post; marriage: delayed; pregnancy: a son; crops: abundant; livestock: thriving."],
    ["Slip 36", "Supreme Auspicious", "Fish Surges Through Peach Waves", "Fish surge through peach waves in the third month. This hour first joy—transforming into dragon form. Seeking office gains the post as predestined. All affairs without worry; celebration renews.", "First I report one root for you to know. Autumn arrives; enterprise succeeds, though late. Meeting the three yangs opening peace, know that name and profit are right on time.", "Auspicious qi greets the gate; all things renew. Meeting honored guests, you draw close of yourselves. Autumn and winter may have slight delay. Spring and summer, people and wealth all succeed.", "Heaven pairs marriage joining both ends. How can consent then also scheme? Clear water shows fish at play. Better drop the silk line and set the hook.", "Slightly knowing the trail, it hides again. Do not blame the innocent when no goods are seen. To know what day lost goods return, watch chen, si, mao, and yin.", "Laughing, the mountain woods gather fierce dens. Why should the good bitterly fret? The master laughs aloud and leaves the gate. Need no weapons—thieves cease of themselves.", "Forgetting the first wish to free yourself, now you ask me of the traveler. If the traveler would know the day of return, wait again for ox and sheep chasing the rat hour.", "Dawn and dusk peril—yet auspicious also. Do not fret long illness wasting support. Swallowing medicines may harm life. Better gather the heart and wait a while.", "Household and people: peaceful; body: auspicious celebration; lost goods: not lost; illness: recovers of itself; lawsuit: in the right; seeking wealth: as wished; traveler: has word; seeking office: certain success; pregnancy: a son; crops: abundant; livestock: thriving, greatly auspicious; marriage: harmonious."],
    ["Slip 37", "Most Inauspicious", "Crossing Without a Boat", "Crossing water without a boat—how can you pass? Waves surge; the force is towering. Going out is unfit; keep to the old. Advance cannot; retreat has no other way.", "Heaven's way toward people is not in haste. Seeing others' wealth, the heart panics. If you now seek name and profit, go ask Hegemon Xiang at the Wu River.", "Without cause, why wander outside? Lest you draw fire and thieves and turn to worry. This spring strictly avoid disaster among people. To gain peace, wait only for autumn.", "Before the eyes the mind wishes quick success. Who knew years and fates do not ascend together? If you would seek people now, wait until the Yellow River's nine waves clear.", "Lost goods clearly lie beside the shore. Seeking fails only because you lack affinity. Going home, measure within the heart. Dare say the hour is adverse—do not blame Heaven.", "Do not carry documents into official peril. Lest entanglement reach the jail. Better withdraw and go home. Let wind and rain fill east and west.", "Idle labor turning to gaze at blue Heaven. The departed guest lingers beside the road. A foot away is like a thousand miles. Sparse letters, vanished news—bitter torment.", "Having method without medicine, illness hard to ease. Divination and gods speak tips of woe. Early go home and cultivate good fortune. Do not let added proof turn to chill of spleen.", "Household and people: unfavorable; self: keep to the old with caution; lost goods: unseen; illness: lingering—make offerings; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; traveler: not yet arrived; lawsuit: unfavorable; seeking office: not yet attained; marriage: will not succeed; pregnancy: misfortune; crops: half ripe; livestock: losses."],
    ["Slip 38", "Great Auspicious", "Red Sun High in Heaven", "Red sun high in Heaven lights ten thousand directions. No dark unlit; surplus radiance spreads. A gentleman advancing must prosper clearly. Glory, wealth, and also peace and health.", "Heaven's way and human heart do not oppose. Naturally aligned with the Way, freed from confusion. In great peace, further feel the gods' aid. North, south, east, west—act as you will.", "Your house's hidden virtue aligns with Heaven's gate. Slight yearly delay; woe does not invade. Livestock, people, wealth—ask not for now. Peace without trouble is worth a thousand gold.", "Mandarin ducks fly into the phoenix nest. Do not let bystanders whisper from behind. By nature affinity—Heaven pairs them. Even without matching years, they harmonize.", "Lost goods have not yet fallen empty. Do not let idle anger vex the heart. Seek urgently straight toward the southern end. Bystanders of themselves will speak the true trail.", "From of old high talent holds high spirit too. Why need to explain with endless talk? Ahead a lofty person's force awaits. Not wasted, the effort of one journey.", "Old promise broken—do not sigh in blame. The traveler has already left the world's edge. Need not now lean on the gate and watch. Meeting si, wu, and sheep, arrive home.", "Small illness on the body—do not slight it. Lest rising fever turn to chill of spleen. Now the baleful star shines true. Without rites of protection, hard to keep safe.", "Household and people: prospering; lost goods: will be seen; illness: offerings—no harm; seeking wealth: greatly fulfilled; lawsuit: in the right; traveler: arrives at once; marriage: achievable; pregnancy: a son; crops: abundant; livestock: thriving; gentlemen: rise in office and rank."],
    ["Slip 39", "Most Inauspicious", "Lost Deep in the Mountains", "Suddenly entering deep mountains, the road is lost. Better return than stay in foxlike doubt. Advance, retreat, travel—all unfavorable. Strictly guard against deceit in the dark.", "Walking the world's edge, matters do not form. Just formed, another shock arrives. Better keep to the old and follow affinity. When spring comes to the world, withered trees bloom.", "Livestock decline; kin grow thin. Strange dreams without cause confuse the dusk. Wait now until after autumn's harvest. Then better change the gate toward the sun.", "Yesterday's planted orchid—how soon fragrance? Who knew tender grass cannot bear frost? If marriage forms today, entering the house you still fear it will not last.", "You worry of loss and ask for news. Only hard to find—not fallen empty. Step back, broaden the heart; in the end you see. Else you raise a noisy uproar.", "Being in the right turns to losing the right. Alas—good affairs become wrong at the end. Entrusting others to mediate is auspicious. Lest entanglement reach the prison gate.", "Asking of the traveler—not yet returned. Busy turning back, already at the village pass. Not that fondness makes return late. Only fine threads of affairs still pull.", "Waiting on medicines, vainly seeking gods. Illness languishes; not yet freed. Under the Dipper there is merit; disaster can be crossed. Then long illness suddenly lightens.", "Household: guard against loss; self: guard against quarrels; women and young ones: misfortune; lost goods: unseen; illness: protective offerings; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; traveler: not yet arrived; lawsuit: unfavorable; seeking office: not yet attained; marriage: hard to achieve; pregnancy: a daughter with empty fright; crops: half harvest; livestock: losses."],
    ["Slip 40", "Great Auspicious", "Swan Soars to Heaven", "The swan soars to Heaven; the force is natural. Season unmet, disaster stretches long. This day rising, free again. Soaring straight up ninefold Heaven.", "The season meets warm law and peaceful scenes. Plans and profit all succeed as wished. If you would act, do it in this hour. Sure to rise and take merit and name.", "No fixed place, strange yet not baleful. Do not hang idle sorrow in the belly. Blessing gods aid with hidden force. Autumn and winter, wealth and joy twofold, threefold.", "In a former life originally of your household. This life meeting, you make kin again. Yet for now the hour has not arrived. Better be slow and wait for people to complete it.", "Lost wealth—you busy yourself. Only because you would not carefully guard. Now lost with no road of return. In the end a bystander will speak the place of news.", "I now report: need not worry. Though lawsuit seems baleful, it has not reached the head. If a noble asks with smiling mouth, the worthy need not write the deposition.", "Several times at Yang Pass you asked the ferry. Unknown to whom letters were sent. Need not now climb the tower and watch. The long guest's return waits at you and chen.", "Without meeting a good physician, illness does not leave. Household wealth declines—do not sigh. Only keep the five lakes' bright moon present. Need not worry there is nowhere to gain gold pearls.", "Household and self: going out auspicious; lost goods: hard to find, yet seen in the end; illness: take medicine; seeking wealth: as wished; traveler: arrives at once; lawsuit: in the right; seeking office: certain success; pregnancy: a son; crops: abundant; livestock: thriving; marriage: succeeds delayed."],
    ["Slip 41", "Most Inauspicious", "Fallen Petals on Flowing Water", "Fallen petals and flowing water—both without feeling. Household anxious; the master has no peace. Young ones and women invite illness and hardship. Urgently pray and petition the gods.", "Once you meant to follow the eastern flow. Wishing to visit Penglai and the ten continents. Unwilling to turn back to old work. Instead buried into barren ruins.", "Ghosts and monsters without cause circle the court. Voices and strange dreams startle people. To know why people and wealth are pressed: only because the road before the gate is uneven.", "Do not hope this person will reach your house. Do not cling and raise empty sighs. Fallen flowers intend to follow flowing water. Flowing water has no feeling to cling to fallen flowers.", "Family reports to you: there is alarming worry. In dreams you cling and will not wake. Already lost—better lower and endure. Do not falsely claim and lose human feeling.", "Wronging the heart in a dark room—Heaven and Earth know. Why at the crisis cry to gods? Being in the right but unfinished—better step back. Lest you meet the rod of law; regret comes late.", "Not that this person does not love home. Only blocked and parted at the world's edge. Seeking with reverence, no road; gazing all day. Twelve Wu Mountains lock the evening clouds.", "Luck adverse, the hour awry, not free. Disaster comes only from bitter greedy seeking. Past the fifteenth, the moon's light lessens. People reaching year's end—all affairs cease.", "Household and self: unfavorable; lost goods: unseen; traveler: not yet arrived; illness: make offerings; pregnancy: a daughter with fright; crops: no harvest; livestock: losses; all affairs: unfavorable."],
    ["Slip 42", "Great Auspicious", "Fish at Play in Water", "Fish at play leave the waves between. Leaping and roaming—not an ordinary sight. Glad to meet fortune's turn; all affairs connect. No further peril lies ahead.", "Ground cold, Heaven chill, water frozen to ice. Settle the heart, keep the will, delight in clear poverty. Now glad that warmth of yang arrives. Roam the four seas as you will.", "This year's spring and summer—how fare affairs? People without worry; livestock many. Late autumn and early winter: slight yearly regret. Better pray for blessing and keep the peace.", "Heaven grants marriage favorable to both. How can consent then be opposed? Another time together form the joined branch. Like water and fish—never briefly parted.", "Lost—need not busy the heart below. Only because without cause you scarce guarded. To know where the trail returns: only by streamside and water's bank.", "Petty folk raise strange blame without cause. The good panic; heart and gall grow cold. Heaven's way will not allow human affairs to twist. The upright will not suffer deceit.", "Weary travel, poor roads, entangled between. Leaving was easy; return is hard. If you ask the day of coming home, wait until fish and dragon leave the shallow shoal.", "Heaven's stars unaligned bring offense. Why at crisis cry to sages? Only keep good thoughts within your heart. Then a hundred illnesses recover of themselves.", "Household and people: peaceful; self: going out auspicious; seeking wealth: fulfilled; traveler: about to arrive; seeking office: gains the post; lawsuit: in the right; marriage: harmonious; pregnancy: a son; crops: abundant; livestock: thriving; all affairs: greatly auspicious."],
    ["Slip 43", "Highly Auspicious", "Sun Rises from Fusang", "Sun rises from Fusang; ten thousand miles bright. Nobles' joyful qi prospers of itself. Seeking wealth and plans match the heart's wish. Asking of office—surely there is a name.", "Several times hardship rose at the second watch. Only for lifelong profit and name. Glad the great sun emerges from the eastern sea. Brightness nowhere fails to prosper.", "A blessing star shines high on your gate. Slight peril need not be debated. People and crops wishing to be steady: before the gods burn much good incense.", "Now glad you meet of your own accord. Right time to wed and complete the rites. Both sides seek each other; no other care. Speak not of age long or age short.", "East-west ancient roads before the old grove. The trail of loss lies within that place. Dead things still become living things. Need not resent and wrong others.", "Right and wrong without cause trap the innocent. Why worry the heart fearing the cane? A noble will come and shout it scattered. In the end no prison—need not startle.", "An old friend long gone at the world's edge. Ten thousand waters, a thousand hills—not yet home. Today the goose transmits letters arriving. Peace reported—free of sighs.", "In peace without trouble you burn no incense. Only at crisis do you cry to the Highest Vault. If your illness would know the day of recovery, you must first cast off worldly filth.", "Household and people: peaceful; self: has joy; lost goods: not lost; illness: no harm; seeking wealth: greatly favorable; traveler: has news; lawsuit: in the right; seeking office: gains the post; marriage: achievable; pregnancy: a son; crops: abundant; livestock: thriving."],
    ["Slip 44", "Lower Middle", "Dark Clouds Cover the Moon", "Dark clouds cover the moon in a haze. In the dark the gate's affairs are not yet right. Only keeping to the old is auspicious. Wait until clouds open—all affairs connect.", "By nature a clever, open-minded person. Just like the bright moon veiled by dark clouds. Casually borrowing force from the eastern wind, scatter floating clouds—the moon shines again.", "House cold, gate declining; a hundred strange things rise. People part, wealth scatters; dream-souls startle. If you ask of peaceful days, you must cultivate the heart and study the Way's scriptures.", "Originally marriage should reunite. Yet bystanders raise chaotic noise. Early settling is less than late settling. Better let the accomplished keep lonely sleep.", "Do not take small matters into a wicked heart. Gods angry, people averse—hard to see the trail. Go south and seek old traces. Need not now beat the breast in confusion.", "Do not quarrel over idle anger and raise official disaster. Arriving there, no dry dispute will come. Better settle peacefully and turn back. Else entanglement enters the jail.", "Letters not yet promised to come often. Who thought midway the crow would lose its flock? Wait until parrots cry and dogs bark. Then the traveler first leaves ten thousand layered clouds.", "Calamity and fortune have no gate—self-invited. Seven passions deeply stain and birth disaster. If you would have the heart at ease, broadly spread hidden merit and give wealth away.", "Household and people: unsettled; self: guard the young; lost goods: unseen; illness: make offerings; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; traveler: not yet arrived; lawsuit: not in the right—settle amicably; seeking office: not yet attained; marriage: hard to achieve; pregnancy: a daughter; crops: half harvest; livestock: losses."],
    ["Slip 45", "Average", "Wind and Thunder Stir", "Wind and thunder stir and spread through Heaven and Earth. All things put forth buds anew this day. A gentleman's plans all succeed as wished. Common folk meet good fortune; the household is revealed.", "After autumn, before spring, desiring profit and name. All mechanisms spent; matters hard to form. If you can keep until the eastern wind arrives, buried will rises; withered trees bloom.", "Diligent incense and fire; blessing gods rejoice. Plague does not invade; evil does not interfere. Spring and summer repeatedly meet layered kiss of trouble. Autumn and winter first joy—peace advances.", "Heaven's marriage is affinity of former hours. Heed not bystanders' wild transmission. Idle delay three or five days, and the pipa is carried into another's boat.", "Since loss, you know no news. Divination and seeking gods are all empty. Only the heart's own hidden virtue is heavy. Now the trail lies east and west.", "At first the sound and force startle people. The good panic; intention is not stolen. If Dongting's return comes after, wind calm, waves still—let the boat go.", "Bystanders' tales do not agree. After leaving, letters show no trace. Luckily this house's hidden merit is heavy. Clearly the person is within great harmony.", "Heart vexed, bones hot, skin further cold. Curses and feud-enemies raise the tip of woe. Early seek Heaven's gods and offer thanks. Then a hundred illnesses ease of themselves.", "Household and people: peaceful; self: no trouble; lost goods: recoverable; illness: recovers of itself; seeking wealth: as wished; traveler: arrives soon; lawsuit: in the right; nobles support; seeking office: prospers; pregnancy: a son; crops: abundant; marriage: suddenly forms; all affairs: greatly auspicious."],
    ["Slip 46", "Most Inauspicious", "Soaring Serpent Enters Dream", "Soaring serpent enters the dream—marks doubt and dread. Guard carefully; thieves deceive the household. Future reform is auspicious. Advance and retreat have not yet met the hour.", "Heart south, intention north—vain clear arranging. Regret's qi has not yet opened. Seeking name and profit is not for this day. Broaden the heart, keep to the old, wait for luck.", "Livestock at times make strange sounds. Nightmares without cause startle people again. To know why people have so many affairs: only because they seek with scarce blessing gods.", "Kin have no road; meeting is too light. Words should pass two or three rounds. Even if forced into kinship after, fear that meeting is only in a dream.", "In dreams reported: there is alarming doubt. Unaware, lack of guard draws thieves to peek. Already lost—seeking hard to see. Passing through courts only draws further wrong.", "Human and ghost affairs cross; matters do not align. Now arrange swiftly and early. Seeing officials is less than private peace. Even winning the hour still costs wealth.", "Sitting and walking, thoughts of the far road. Layered hills block; not yet home. If you would see a kin's face, wait until toad-light turns beyond the sea's edge.", "Bitter illness wraps the body—unbearable. Seeking physicians brings no effect; hard to measure. Wishing recovery is no better than a southern-branch dream. You must cultivate the body and do good.", "Household: not theft; self: guard against quarrels; lost goods: hard to find; illness: protective offerings; pregnancy: a daughter with empty fright; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; lawsuit: not in the right; seeking office: not yet attained; marriage: will not succeed; traveler: not yet arrived; crops: half harvest; livestock: losses."],
    ["Slip 47", "Average", "Dense Clouds, No Rain", "Dense clouds, no rain—still a gray haze. Marks doubt and dread, yet also no great harm. Further, petty folk come to harm you. Household dark and obscure—affairs need guarding.", "Extremity and peace alternate—the principle is natural. Do not fret that luck long stagnates. Sometimes borrowing force of spring wind scatters floating clouds and shows blue Heaven.", "Gate and court dark; ghostly evil many. Kin startle and worry—what to do? To gain peace you must honor ancestors. Change the heart and chant Amitabha.", "Marriage predestined—do not force it. Even if forced, later it goes wrong. This place not keeping must seek another place. Why labor with intent and draw delusion?", "Laughable—floating life busies itself in vain. Not knowing Heaven's net spreads in the dark. Bloom and wither, gain and loss, all predestined. From of old floating life does not last long.", "Lawsuit drifts on and will not end. I charge you earnestly: need not worry. Meeting days when dragon and tiger join, need no weapons—it ceases of itself.", "Gazing far, traveler's news is sparse. Unknown good or ill breeds foxlike doubt. If you ask true news now: snake and horse meeting ox is the due date.", "Chance without cause—suddenly you meet offense. Surely the departed want paper money. Vows in the heart should be repaid early. Do not let lingering keep you bedridden.", "Household and people: slight misfortune, unsettled; self: guard against quarrels; lost goods: unseen; traveler: not yet arrived; illness: make offerings; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; lawsuit: lingering; seeking office: not yet attained; marriage: will not succeed; pregnancy: a daughter; crops: half harvest."],
    ["Slip 48", "Great Auspicious", "Newly Polished Precious Sword", "Newly polished precious sword—light increases. East and west it shines, doubling the common. From before, foundations already lay. Polish adds brightness; fame spreads afar.", "A hundred temperings, a thousand grindings passed this body. Years quiet, trapped in dust. Now borrowing a fine craftsman's force, meeting officials and nobles—glad to see the new.", "Fierce disaster past; blessing gods arrive. Do not fret that household poverty will not raise wealth. Going forth, people and livestock sure to thrive. Autumn and winter double; all in harmony.", "Rearrange gauze robes—more stylish and new. You think fit to be of this household. Who knew that later hearts would differ? Fear the water-caltrop flower stained with dust again.", "Sudden woe flies in; wealth must break. Do not now guess against the crowd. Trails exist, yet hard to gain complete. Loss seen within the year may spare disaster.", "From of old, yielding to others is not folly. Though the matter has reason, still it comes late. The hall has a true bright mirror. In haste hard to sort black from white.", "Each meeting letters not yet seen as true. Empty labor—secret intention praying to Heaven's gods. To know the departed guest's peace, wait until dragon and snake arrive—then clear.", "Heaven's reproach of mortals—how would they know? Chance meeting grinding obstacles wastes support. Now swiftly seek protective rites. Do not wait for the crisis; regret comes late.", "Household and people: slight misfortune—no harm; lost goods: recoverable; self: renewal auspicious; traveler: not yet arrived but has word; illness: protective rites; seeking wealth: as wished; lawsuit: settle amicably; seeking office: certain success; marriage: reunites; pregnancy: a son; crops: abundant; livestock: thriving."],
    ["Slip 49", "Most Inauspicious", "Flock of Crows Cawing", "A flock of crows gathering to caw is not yet strange. Guard carefully against women's quarrelsome deceit. Only after retreating can you be spared. Else affairs' threads mark doubt and dread.", "Do not hope for lamb and fine wine poured. Fish letters and ulcerous news both sink deep. The magpie nest is already claimed by crows. Ten thousand schemes waste the heart in vain.", "Quarrels without cause arrive suddenly. Only because the household holds suspicion. Returning, swiftly seek divine blessing. Lest people suffer Heaven's disaster.", "Do not trust bystanders' wild talk. Lotus cannot match chrysanthemum's fragrance. Better step back and open the eyes again. Do not take crows for phoenixes.", "You yourself were careless at the time. Now lost—hard to find. Do not draw bystanders' uproar. Suffering insult and calamity—how can it be stopped?", "Noisy idle affairs clamor and heat. Later doubt and dread mark seeing the baleful. Reaching the hall to sort right from wrong, one round of peril fills the empty air.", "This final slip unfavorable for asking of travelers. The guest's road is busy; not yet turned. Midway worry and disaster disturb. Early seek vast fortune and knock the dragon god.", "Disaster and illness linger, not yet whole. Sincerely seek blessing and tell Heaven's gods. If the anxious heart does not reform, meeting demons—even recovery still costs money.", "Household: women and young ones have misfortune; self: quarrels; lost goods: unseen; illness: unsettled—make offerings; traveler: not yet arrived; seeking office: not yet attained; seeking wealth: not yet fulfilled; lawsuit: empty fright; marriage: will not succeed; pregnancy: a daughter; livestock and crops: losses."]
]
